        "id": 14837,
        "title": "Pengenalan Enum",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Enum atau <em>enumeration</em> memberikan nama yang lebih mudah dipahami pada sekumpulan konstanta bernama. Kita memulainya dengan keyword <code>enum</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enum</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 131073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kemudian kita juga memerlukan nama untuk enum serta kurung kurawal buka dan tutup.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Directions</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy",
            "id": 131074,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Terakhir, tambahkan nilai-nilai di dalam kurung kurawal, dipisahkan dengan koma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Up,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam TypeScript, setiap anggota enum secara otomatis diberi angka yang dimulai dari <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Up);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa mengatur nilai anggota enum secara manual. Kita hanya perlu melakukannya pada anggota pertama, dan anggota lainnya akan bertambah secara otomatis.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Up);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Down);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Left);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Right);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ini juga berlaku sebaliknya. Enum di TypeScript adalah objek. Jadi, kamu juga bisa mendapatkan nama member enum dari nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Up\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa itu enum dalam TypeScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cara memberikan nama yang lebih mudah dipahami untuk sekumpulan nilai numerik</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sekumpulan konstanta bernama</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cara memberikan nama yang lebih mudah dipahami untuk sekumpulan nilai numerik.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 130970,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selesaikan deklarasi enum.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Days {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Monday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Tuesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Wednesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Thursday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Friday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Saturday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Sunday\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>enum</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130968,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Months {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jan = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Feb,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Mar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Apr\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Months.Mar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Mar</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari berikut ini cara yang benar untuk mendeklarasikan enum di TypeScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>enum Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enumerate Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enum Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 130971,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cetak <code>Friday</code> ke console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Days {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Monday = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Tuesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Wednesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Thursday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Friday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Saturday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Sunday\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Days[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Friday\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 130972,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan dicetak ke konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Left);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"52\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">52</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">50</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">51</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 52.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 14838,
        "title": "Enum yang Berbeda",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa menggunakan nilai string, bukan angka yang bertambah otomatis.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MusicGenres {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Classical = \" /><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Rock = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ROCK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Pop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;POP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jazz = \" /><text value=\"&quot;JAZZ&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Classical</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"CLASSICAL\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130975,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita mencetak nilai enum ini, nilai string akan ditampilkan di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MusicGenres {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Classical = \" /><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Rock = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ROCK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Pop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;POP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jazz = \" /><text value=\"&quot;JAZZ&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(MusicGenres.Classical);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"CLASSICAL\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>MusicGenres</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>Classical</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130976,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Satu enum dapat menyimpan angka dan string. Mari buat enum yang menyimpan satu angka dan satu string.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Options {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Yes = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" No = \" /><text value=\"&quot;NO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Options.Yes);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Options.No);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NO\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"NO\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa output dari kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Status {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Active = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Inactive = \" /><text value=\"&quot;INACTIVE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Status.Active);\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">1</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">TIDAK AKTIF</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 1.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisakah kita mencampur tipe dalam enum?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Ya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Membuat enum yang hanya berisi string.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Day {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Monday = \" /><text value=\"&quot;MONDAY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Tuesday = \" /><text value=\"&quot;TUESDAY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Wednesday = \" /><text value=\"&quot;WEDNESDAY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"MONDAY\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"TUESDAY\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"WEDNESDAY\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 130982,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengakses anggota enum?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menggunakan notasi titik, misalnya <code>Enum.Member</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menggunakan tanda kurung siku, misalnya <code>Enum[\"Member\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menggunakan notasi titik, misalnya <code>Enum.Member</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 130983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan anggota baru <code>HipHop = \"HIPHOP\"</code> ke Enum MusicGenres yang sudah ada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MusicGenres {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Classical = \" /><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Rock = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ROCK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Pop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;POP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jazz = \" /><text value=\"&quot;JAZZ&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" HipHop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HIPHOP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>HipHop</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"HIPHOP\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
